     "text": [
      "cmax_skew_vec (Newton) vs. cmax_skew (exakt): max. Abweichung 5.6e-16   (7 Testpaare)\n",
      "run_stats_2d vs. run_stats                  : c 0.0e+00, g1 0.0e+00, g2 0.0e+00   (k >= 50)\n",
      "\n",
